%!PS
% gs -dNOSAFER

% https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Intersex-inclusive_pride_flag.svg

(cowsaypride.ps) run

6 0 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEPURPLE stripe
6 1 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEDARKBLUE stripe
6 2 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEGREEN stripe
6 3 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEYELLOW stripe
6 4 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEORANGE stripe
6 5 INTERSEXINCLUSIVERED stripe

% from 1200 x 762 image
% black chevron apex: 667.133 (half)
% brown: 593.223 (half)
% cyan 520.333 (half) 
% pink: 447.417 (half)
% white: 373.517 (half)
% gold: 300.617 (half) x 650.167 (height).  smallest half-diagonal is 1/4 total width
% white chevron covers corner, more "inside" than "outside"
% left edge of circle aligns vertically with left edge of pink chevron

% circle center at (111, 381) radius 80 stroke-width 19
% radius 1/15 of width
% stroke width is slightly less than gap from left edge
% circle center is 0.0925 (111/1200) of total width from left edge

/CHEVRONDELTA 54 def
/QUARTERWIDTH PAGEWIDTH 4 div def

QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 5 mul add BLACK leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 4 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVEBROWN leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 3 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVELIGHTBLUE leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 2 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVEPINK leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA add WHITE leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH INTERSEXINCLUSIVEGOLD leftedgechevron

newpath
INTERSEXINCLUSIVEVIOLET setrgbcolor
PAGEWIDTH 111 mul 1200 div PAGEHEIGHT 2 div PAGEWIDTH 15 div 0 360 arc 14 setlinewidth stroke

cowtrace

% invert stripe color sequence within cow head
typicalcowplace
6 0 INTERSEXINCLUSIVERED stripe
6 1 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEORANGE stripe
6 2 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEYELLOW stripe
6 3 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEGREEN stripe
6 4 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEDARKBLUE stripe
6 5 INTERSEXINCLUSIVEPURPLE stripe

% permute chevron color sequence within cow head
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 5 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVEPINK leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 4 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVELIGHTBLUE leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 3 mul add INTERSEXINCLUSIVEBROWN leftedgechevron
QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA 2 mul add BLACK leftedgechevron
% cow head doesn't extend this far
% QUARTERWIDTH CHEVRONDELTA add WHITE leftedgechevron
% QUARTERWIDTH INTERSEXINCLUSIVEGOLD leftedgechevron

showpage
